{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887370/extras/e85ad45e89003076501593217ad8a8ee.avif?t=1768186104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887370/extras_big/e85ad45e89003076501593217ad8a8ee.webp?t=1768186104 width=1560 height=345 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">What if the Royal playing cards had a kingdom?  <strong> </strong>  <br>What if there was more than just a Jack, Queen, and King?    <br>What if these Royals had to defend themselves from invaders?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong> <br>In Luxuriant, a  deck-building high strategy roguelike, you assemble a deck of Royals, Citizens, Weapons, and Resources, then fight through your Kingdoms Districts that are being actively invaded! \u00a0Each battle will chip away your deck as you store up Jewels to recruit more Citizens and Royals to the fray. Victory is determined by cumulative Points, and every decision, from which Royals to promote to which Weapons to Use WILL tip the balance between triumph and defeat. \u00a0<u>The last boss is not a duck.</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ Royal Cards with unique abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ Citizen Cards with unique abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Weapon Cards including!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35+ Enemy Cards! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ Levels!! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ Status Effects with unique visual designs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Enemy Effects with custom combat mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Card Suits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ Unlockable Cards!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4,000,000,000+ Seeds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35+ Quests with Rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35+ Steam Achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Save Slots!! (Cloud Saving too!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Bosses with Unique Transformations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Rare Cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Booster Packs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade &amp; Unlock Shops including Forging Cards, Awakening Weapons, and Enchanting Royals!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slot machines!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Weather </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night Cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive sound engine using layered mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOON CARDS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Tutorials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite Progression Loops!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AND MORE.....</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887370?t=1768186104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887370/444fceb27a423289fc1dc14c72ecd8420c01a59c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768186104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887370/c5cfc29732c972585e216ff91b3fa5610c4a1c02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768186104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887370/c5cfc29732c972585e216ff91b3fa5610c4a1c02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768186104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"not